<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>JPA 페이징</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: "Segoe UI", sans-serif; margin: 40px; background: #f8fafc; color: #0f172a; }
        main { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: white; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08); }
        th, td { padding: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; text-align: left; }
        .summary { background: white; padding: 18px 20px; border-radius: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
    <h1>예제 (3) / 예제 (4) Spring MVC + Mustache + JPA</h1>
    <div class="summary">
        <p>JPA는 0페이지부터 시작하므로 Controller에서 받은 <strong>page</strong>를 Service에 넘길 때 <strong>page - 1</strong>을 적용한다.</p>
        <p>현재 페이지: {{currentPage}} / 전체 페이지 수: {{totalPages}}</p>
    </div>

    <form action="/jpa/boards/search" method="get">
        <input type="text" name="keyword" value="{{keyword}}" placeholder="제목 검색어">
        <button type="submit">검색</button>
    </form>

    <table>
        <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>ID</th>
            <th>제목</th>
            <th>내용</th>
        </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
        {{#boards}}
            <tr>
                <td>{{id}}</td>
                <td>{{title}}</td>
                <td>{{content}}</td>
            </tr>
        {{/boards}}
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="summary">
        {{#hasPrevious}}
            <a href="{{path}}?keyword={{keyword}}&page={{previousPage}}">이전</a>
        {{/hasPrevious}}

        {{#pageNumbers}}
            {{#current}}
                <strong>{{number}}</strong>
            {{/current}}
            {{^current}}
                <a href="{{path}}?keyword={{keyword}}&page={{number}}">{{number}}</a>
            {{/current}}
        {{/pageNumbers}}

        {{#hasNext}}
            <a href="{{path}}?keyword={{keyword}}&page={{nextPage}}">다음</a>
        {{/hasNext}}
    </div>

    <p><a href="/">홈으로</a></p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
